{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the Earth lies the Sea of Souls, the origin of all life\u2019s reincarnation. When a living being dies, their soul returns to the Sea, resting in peace until it is ready to be reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek to harness the Sea's power for control over life and death. Others wish to destroy the cycle entirely, believing true peace lies in oblivion. The balance of existence teeters on the edge, and you are caught in the middle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you preserve the cycle, or bring it all to an end?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover secrets with multiple unlockable abilities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as a cat. Well, two cats, actually. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise and plan your turns accordingly with a combo-based combat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question your life choices! (In-Game and irl) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of colorful characters! And a couple of colorless ones too... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bless your eyes and ears with beautiful pixel art and an original soundtrack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a chicken in the game. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695580?t=1772598883","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695580/f3938cea6ba403106fce59c3053e87a41bebcd9d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772598883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695580/2d9ea64b9e7f9fd7d531755d0eca4a36cf3e0664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772598883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695580/2d9ea64b9e7f9fd7d531755d0eca4a36cf3e0664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772598883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the Earth lies the Sea of Souls, the origin of all life\u2019s reincarnation. When a living being dies, their soul returns to the Sea, resting in peace until it is ready to be reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek to harness the Sea's power for control over life and death. Others wish to destroy the cycle entirely, believing true peace lies in oblivion. The balance of existence teeters on the edge, and you are caught in the middle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you preserve the cycle, or bring it all to an end?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover secrets with multiple unlockable abilities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as a cat. Well, two cats, actually. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise and plan your turns accordingly with a combo-based combat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question your life choices! (In-Game and irl) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of colorful characters! And a couple of colorless ones too... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bless your eyes and ears with beautiful pixel art and an original soundtrack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a chicken in the game. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Luca Tomba"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":